o attack, the more damage those units will take.", "notes_zh": ["即使拉席克死亡，爆炸还是会在原地继续。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["num_explosions", "radius", "affects_buildings", "damage", "targets", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "leshrac_lightning_storm", "name_zh": "拉席克·闪电风暴", "name_en": "Lightning Storm", "description_zh": "召唤一片闪电风暴攻击目标敌方单位，并跳跃到附近的敌方单位。被攻击的敌人将会被降低移动速度。", "description_en": "Summons a lightning storm that blasts the target enemy unit, then strikes any nearby enemy units. Struck enemies have their move speed slowed.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "jump_count", "radius", "jump_delay", "movespeed_slow", "slow_duration", "pulse_nova_lightning_interval", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "leshrac_greater_lightning_storm", "name_zh": "拉席克·虚无主义", "name_en": "Nihilism", "description_zh": "使拉席克和范围内所有敌人变为虚无状态，他们无法攻击，并且承受的魔法伤害增加，移动速度被减缓。拉席克的移动速度得到提升，而不是减缓。拉席克受到的魔法伤害不会增加。", "description_en": "Causes Leshrac and all nearby enemies to turn ethereal, preventing them from attacking, slowing them, and making them take more magic damage. Increases Leshrac's speed rather than reducing it. Does not cause Leshrac to take amplified damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "magic_amp", "slow", "radius", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "leshrac_defilement", "name_zh": "拉席克·大肆污染", "name_en": "Defilement", "description_zh": "拉席克的每点智力都会提供%aoe_per_int%作用范围加成。", "description_en": "Leshrac gains %aoe_per_int% Area of Effect Bonus per Intelligence.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["aoe_per_int", "current_aoe_bonus"]}, {"subject": "leshrac_pulse_nova", "name_zh": "拉席克·脉冲新星", "name_en": "Pulse Nova", "description_zh": "拉席克在他周围创造破坏性的能量波，每秒对附近敌方单位造成伤害。每次脉冲都会消耗拉席克的魔法。", "description_en": "Creates waves of damaging energy around Leshrac, one per second, to damage nearby enemy units. Drains Leshrac's mana with each pulse.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["mana_cost_per_second", "radius", "damage", "damage_resistance", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "furion_sprout", "name_zh": "自然先知·发芽", "name_en": "Sprout", "description_zh": "使一圈树木在一个单位的周围发芽，将其困在其中并造成伤害，提供%vision_range%范围内的视野。", "description_en": "Sprouts a ring of trees around a unit, damaging and trapping it in place and providing vision in a %vision_range% radius.", "notes_zh": ["发芽的施放目标可以是任何单位或者地面。", "发芽产生的树木跟英雄技能的相互作用与平常树木相同。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["vision_range", "duration", "sprout_damage", "sprout_damage_radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "furion_teleportation", "name_zh": "自然先知·传送", "name_en": "Teleportation", "description_zh": "传送到地图上任何位置。到达地点后获得一个护盾。", "description_en": "Teleports to any point on the map. Gains a barrier after arriving to its destination.", "notes_zh": ["魔耗和冷却时间都是在技能施放结束后结算。自然先知在施放技能时被打断将不会耗费魔法或使技能进入冷却。", "施法开始后，目标地点将产生视觉特效，对队友和敌人均可见。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["barrier", "buff_duration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "furion_force_of_nature", "name_zh": "自然先知·自然的呼唤", "name_en": "Nature's Call", "description_zh": "将一片树木转化成由自然先知操控的树人。", "description_en": "Converts an area of trees into Treants under the command of Nature's Prophet.", "notes_zh": ["自然的呼唤产生的树人不会超过目标区域内树木的数量。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["area_of_effect", "max_treants", "treant_duration", "treant_health", "treant_damage", "treant_bonus_hero_damage", "treant_movespeed", "treant_vision_day", "treant_vision_night", "treant_gold_bounty_min", "treant_gold_bounty_max", "treant_xp_bounty", "treewalking", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint"]}, {"subject": "furion_curse_of_the_forest", "name_zh": "自然先知·青森诅咒", "name_en": "Curse of the Oldgrowth", "description_zh": "对%range%范围内所有敌方英雄施加诅咒，使他们在迷雾中显形，根据%radius%范围内树木的数量对他们造成减速和持续伤害。在此情况下树人也被视为树木。", "description_en": "Applies a curse on all enemy heroes within %range% range, displaying them in fog, slowing them, and dealing damage over time based on the number of trees within %radius% radius. Treants count as trees for this purpose.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "damage_per_tree", "slow_per_tree", "radius", "range", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "furion_spirit_of_the_forest", "name_zh": "自然先知·丛林之魂", "name_en": "Spirit of the Forest", "description_zh": "附近的每棵树都会让自然先知获得%damage_per_tree_pct%%%攻击力加成。每个树人也会让自然先知获得若干倍数的加成，不论相距多远。树人也拥有这个技能。", "description_en": "Nature's Prophet gains %damage_per_tree_pct%%% bonus damage for each nearby tree. Treants also provide this bonus with multiplied values regardless of proximity. Treants also possess this ability.", "notes_zh": ["树人会从周围的树木和其他树人获得加成效果。", "树精卫士不提供任何加成。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["damage_per_tree_pct", "radius_base", "multiplier"]}, {"subject": "furion_wrath_of_nature", "name_zh": "自然先知·自然之怒", "name_en": "Wrath of Nature", "description_zh": "伤害性的能量在全地图跳跃，打击视野中的敌人，会先从距目标点最近的敌人开始打击。每击中一个敌人伤害都会增加，击中%max_targets%个目标后达到最高伤害。", "description_en": "Damaging energy bounces around the map, striking enemies that are in vision starting with those closest to the cast point. Each enemy hit beyond the first adds damage, up to the maximum after %max_targets% are hit.", "notes_zh": ["自然的愤怒只能伤害视野内的单位。", "可以通过点击小地图施放；初始目标将选择施放地点最近的有效单位。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "缠绕所有击中的敌人。持续时间根据弹跳次序从%scepter_min_entangle_duration%秒开始增加，弹跳数达到上限时为%scepter_max_entangle_duration%秒。", "en": "Entangles all enemies it hits. Duration scales from %scepter_min_entangle_duration%s up to %scepter_max_entangle_duration%s seconds at max bounce."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_targets", "damage", "damage_percent_add", "jump_delay", "scepter_min_entangle_duration", "scepter_max_entangle_duration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "life_stealer_rage", "name_zh": "噬魂鬼·狂暴", "name_en": "Rage", "description_zh": "进入狂暴状态，变成减益免疫，提升魔法抗性和移动速度。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Launch into a maddened rage, becoming Debuff Immune, increasing magic resistance and gaining movement speed.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "magic_resist", "debuff_immunity", "movespeed_bonus", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "life_stealer_open_wounds", "name_zh": "噬魂鬼·撕裂伤口", "name_en": "Open Wounds", "description_zh": "噬魂鬼撕裂一个敌方单位，减缓受害者的移动速度，并使所有友军在攻击该单位时根据造成的伤害回复一定比例的生命。受害者在持续时间内逐渐恢复移动速度。", "description_en": "Lifestealer rends an enemy unit, slowing the victim's movement speed and allowing all allies to regain health for a percentage of the damage they deal to that unit. The victim recovers movement speed over the duration.", "notes_zh": ["撕裂伤口的减速有8个独立的阶段：50%/50%/40%/30%/20%/10%/10%/10%，每过一秒就会进入下个阶段，减速效果不断降低。", "治疗数值会被噬魂鬼的生命回复增强效果提升。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "slow_steps", "heal_percent", "spread_radius", "slow_step_pct_of_max", "slow_tooltip", "attack_speed_on_target", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "life_stealer_feast", "name_zh": "噬魂鬼·盛宴", "name_en": "Feast", "description_zh": "噬魂鬼每次攻击时还会根据目标最大生命值的一定百分比造成伤害，同时获得治疗。每次击杀单位他都会获得永久生命上限。", "description_en": "Lifestealer's attacks deal damage and provide heal for a percentage of his target's max health. He gains permanent max HP whenever he kills a unit.", "notes_zh": ["对友军和敌人有效。对肉山无效。", "回复量与造成伤害相互独立。", "破坏会使技能无法获得新的叠加效果。", "破坏不会使现有叠加效果提供的加成失效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["hp_leech_percent", "hp_damage_percent", "creep_deny_percent", "bonus_hp_per_hero", "bonus_hp_per_creep", "bonus_hp_total"]}, {"subject": "life_stealer_ghoul_frenzy", "name_zh": "噬魂鬼·尸鬼狂怒", "name_en": "Ghoul Frenzy", "description_zh": "被动提升噬魂鬼的攻击速度。", "description_en": "Passively grants Lifestealer Attack Speed.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["movement_speed_bonus", "attack_speed_bonus"]}, {"subject": "life_stealer_infest", "name_zh": "噬魂鬼·感染", "name_en": "Infest", "description_zh": "噬魂鬼进入目标单位的身体，无法被察觉，而且自身在体内时每秒恢复最大生命值的一定百分比。接着可以从宿主体内现身，对周围所有敌方单位造成伤害。如果被感染单位是敌方非英雄单位或中立生物，噬魂鬼可以控制其进行移动和攻击，而且该生物会持续失去最大生命值的一部分。无法对敌方英雄生效。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Lifestealer infests the body of a target unit, becoming undetectable, and healing for a portion of his max hitpoints every second while inside. He can then explode from the host body, dealing damage to nearby enemies. If the infested unit is an enemy creep or a neutral creep, he can take control of the unit's ability to move and attack, and the creep loses a portion of their max hitpoints over time. Does not work on enemy heroes.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["噬魂鬼在感染一个单位期间能够从周围死亡的单位身上获得经验。", "被感染控制的单位会获得感染的移动速度加成。", "不会触发法术反弹。", "感染可以对远古生物使用。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升施法距离并且冷却时间降低至%bonus_AbilityCooldown%秒。感染可以对敌方英雄施放，持续时间较短，并在他们体内发动攻击，同时提升噬魂鬼的恢复速率。", "en": "Increases cast range and reduces cooldown to %bonus_AbilityCooldown%s.  Infest may target enemy heroes for a short duration, attacking them from the inside while increasing Lifestealer's regeneration rate."}, "shard": {"zh": "吞噬感染的中立生物会使敌人沾满鲜血，根据宿主的剩余生命值造成持续伤害。", "en": "Consuming a creep with Infest drenches enemies in blood which deals damage over time based on the host's remaining health."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "damage", "bonus_movement_speed", "bonus_health", "self_regen", "infest_duration_enemy", "attack_rate_enemy", "creep_max_hp_drain_pct_per_second", "can_target_ancients", "dot_damage_as_pct_of_damage_dealt", "dot_duration", "dot_tick_interval", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost"]}, {"subject": "dark_seer_vacuum", "name_zh": "黑暗贤者·真空", "name_en": "Vacuum", "description_zh": "黑暗贤者在目标区域制造一个真空环境，将周围的敌方单位吸入，具有打断效果并造成伤害。", "description_en": "Dark Seer creates a vacuum over the target area that sucks in enemy units, disrupting them and dealing damage.", "notes_zh": ["此技能可以打断持续施法。", "牵引过程为%duration%秒，伤害在牵引后产生。", "真空中央附近的树木将会被摧毁。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "duration", "damage", "radius_tree", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "dark_seer_ion_shell", "name_zh": "黑暗贤者·离子外壳", "name_en": "Ion Shell", "description_zh": "将目标用一个尖刺之盾包裹起来，对周围的敌人造成伤害。", "description_en": "Surrounds the target unit with a bristling shield that damages enemy units in an area around it.", "notes_zh": ["每%tick_interval%秒造成一次若干伤害。", "离子外壳对其作用单位没有伤害。", "如果对已经套上离子外壳的单位再次施放，新的离子外壳会取代旧的。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "damage_per_second", "duration", "tick_interval", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "dark_seer_surge", "name_zh": "黑暗贤者·奔腾", "name_en": "Surge", "description_zh": "为一个友方目标注入能量，使其在短时间内移动速度爆发，并且获得相位移动状态。允许单位达到移动速度上限，并且无法被减速。", "description_en": "Charges a target friendly unit with power, giving it a brief burst of phased movement speed. Allows the unit to reach maximum movement speed and cannot be slowed.", "notes_zh": ["奔腾的单位不受减速影响，除非奔腾效果消失。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "奔腾单位的身后留下一道路径，作用范围为%trail_radius%，持续%trail_duration%秒，对附近的敌人造成%trail_move_slow%%%减速，并且每秒造成%trail_damage%点伤害，伤害间隔为%trail_damage_interval%秒。可以设为多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标），禁止留下路径。", "en": "Surged units leave behind a %trail_radius% radius trail that lasts %trail_duration%s, slows enemies around it by %trail_move_slow%%% and deals %trail_damage% damage per second in %trail_damage_interval%s intervals. Can be put on alt-cast to disable the trail."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "speed_boost", "trail_radius", "trail_duration", "trail_move_slow", "trail_damage", "trail_damage_interval", "aoe_radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "dark_seer_normal_punch", "name_zh": "黑暗贤者·普通一拳", "name_en": "Normal Punch", "description_zh": "被动技能。使黑暗贤者下次对英雄的攻击具有克敌机先效果，可以打出目标的复制体，并且根据过去%recent_duration%秒内黑暗贤者的移动距离造成伤害和眩晕。移动%max_distance%距离以上将造成最大威力。", "description_en": "Passive ability. Causes Dark Seer's next attack on a hero to have True Strike, knock a replica out of the victim, damaging and stunning them based on how far Dark Seer has moved in the past %recent_duration% seconds. Max power is reached after %max_distance% distance moved.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["max_stun", "recent_duration", "max_distance", "knockback_distance", "illusion_duration", "max_damage", "normal_punch_illusion_delay", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "dark_seer_aggrandize", "name_zh": "黑暗贤者·才思敏捷", "name_en": "Quick Wit", "description_zh": "黑暗贤者从每点智力获得%int_to_atkspd%攻击速度。\n\n黑暗贤者升级时会恢复最大生命值和魔法值的一定百分比。", "description_en": "Dark Seer gains %int_to_atkspd% Attack Speed from each point of Intelligence.\n\nWhen Dark Seer levels up, he restores a percentage of his max health and mana.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["int_to_atkspd", "attack_speed_tooltip", "heal_pct"]}, {"subject": "dark_seer_wall_of_replica", "name_zh": "黑暗贤者·复制之墙", "name_en": "Wall of Replica", "description_zh": "制造一堵扭曲的光墙，对穿过的敌方英雄造成伤害和减速，并复制一个其自身的幻象，幻象由黑暗贤者控制，持续到光墙消失，或者被敌人消灭。", "description_en": "Raises a wall of warping light that slows, damages, and creates replicas of any enemy hero who crosses it. Enemy replicas serve at the Dark Seer's will. Replicas last until they are destroyed, or until the wall's duration ends.", "notes_zh": ["幻象不会产生幻象。", "每堵光墙同一时间产生的为一名英雄产生的幻象只有一个。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "replica_damage_outgoing", "tooltip_outgoing", "replica_damage_incoming", "tooltip_replica_total_damage_incoming", "width", "movement_slow", "slow_duration", "scepter_length_multiplier", "wall_damage", "cooldown_reduction", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "clinkz_strafe", "name_zh": "克林克兹·扫射", "name_en": "Strafe", "description_zh": "克林克兹获得攻击速度和攻击距离加成。克林克兹%strafe_skeleton_radius%范围内现有的骷髅弓手也会获得攻击距离加成和%archer_attack_speed_pct%%%攻击速度加成。施放扫射不会脱离骨隐步的隐身状态。", "description_en": "Clinkz gains attack speed and has bonus attack range. Any current Skeleton Archers within a %strafe_skeleton_radius% radius of Clinkz also gain bonus attack range and %archer_attack_speed_pct%%% of the attack speed bonus.  Casting Strafe does not break Skeleton Walk invisibility.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["attack_speed_bonus", "duration", "attack_range_bonus", "strafe_skeleton_radius", "archer_attack_speed_pct", "debuff_duration", "blind_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}]
